premise='Fixed defaultR/B8/nooverride; complete original49QC fixture premises retained. Valid ordinary Pokemon/Species/rules/template/AI/scene/error/UI objects and normal prior callbacks to each stated observation unless a named failure/propagated exception is considered. Abstract members supply exactly the stated species/baseStats/level/item/egg/evolution/heightweight fields; named raw records are bounded to those fully read below. Source predicates/combination existence/constant vectors manually derived only, no Ruby/reference/eligibility algorithm/independent business model/native execution. Allnormal compiler/cache/record/growthcurve requirements remain explicit; no whole453species/649classes/2732provenances proof is inferred. Direct state/tool/order/invalidlevel/newmember fixtures do not assert ordinary UI/defaultDemo reachability.'
manual=[
 ('RC-PRIMARYSPECIES','SLAKING7629–7651','Complete default Slaking ordinary abilities contains TRUANT and literal baseStats sum150+160+100+100+95+65=670. Standard permission reads the species ordinary list before BST, independent of the individual resolved ability.'),
 ('RC-PRIMARYSPECIES','DRAGONITE3937–3961/WYNAUT9513–9538','Complete default Dragonite baseStats sum91+134+95+80+100+100=600 and is explicit Standard whitelist; complete Wynaut ordinary ShadowTag/hiddenTelepathy does not evade explicit Standard rejection. Egg rejection precedes these species checks.'),
 ('C-LAPRAS-PBS','Lapras3453–3480 withreceivedFIP-F05','Complete Lapras HPbase130/speed60/Growl1/PerishSong60, given L60/EV0/neutral, yield manually HPfloor260*60/100+70=226; speedIV20→floor140*60/100+5=89 andIV0→floor120*60/100+5=77. Full stats consumer is received FIP-F05, not FIP-F04.'),
 ('RC-PRIMARYMOVES','PERISHSONG6225–6234/GROWL5961–5970','Complete default PerishSong is Status/accuracy0/PP5/AllBattlers/StartPerishCountsForAllBattlers/Sound; Growl Status/AllNearFoes/PP40/LowerTargetAttack1. Q43/44 explicitly supply actual learned/current moves and successful uses, no default constructor last-four guarantee.'),
 ('RC-PRIMARYITEMS','SOULDEW2080–2086/ORANBERRY5252–5260','Both exact complete default item records are read. SoulDew description does not choose its consumer branch; actual type-power switch and clause gates do. ORANBERRY identity is only restored as a held item in Q45, not consumed/healed by an invented step.'),
 ('S01','item552–566','Pokemon.item getter resolves @item, item_id returns storage; setter ignores truthy unknown value, otherwise stores canonical Item.get(value).id or falsey value unchanged. Thus wrapper missing saved item indexnil actually clears held item storage under stated normal object inputs.'),
 ('S13','MultipleEntry1051–1139','Multiple-entry first calls hasValidTeam; false returnsnil before scene. Valid members initially status1/NOT ENTERED, invalid2/BANNED. Selected status=rank+3 maps FIRST/SECOND/etc and actual sceneAnnotate assigns corresponding sprite text.'),
 ('S13','MultipleEntry1051–1139','Each iteration reconstructs selection in rank order and compacts ranks. A just-added selection auto-focuses CONFIRM iff length==ruleset.number. Capacity rejection requires length>=number AND number>0; rawzero/negative number disables that UI guard independently of final maxLength.'),
 ('S13','MultipleEntry1051–1139','Confirm builds selected reference array in rank order, asks final isValid with errorarray, breaks ontrue else displays firsterror/clearsret and continues. DirectBACK breaks withnil/no committedselection. UI/annotation/refresh/display callbacks must complete normally.'),
 ('S13','QC48 raw0 finite vector','Raw max0 with min1 and no teamrules can pass hasValidTeam on nonempty validinput. UI acceptsA/B andshowsFIRST/SECOND with no positive capacity/focus. Confirmtwo passesmin1 thenfailsmax0; emptyconfirmfailsmin1. BACKreturnsnil. This finite vector doesnot alter final count validation.'),
 ('S13','QC48 explicit1/3 finite vectors','Explicitset1 acceptsA→FIRST/focusCONFIRM, rejectsnewB, returns[A]onvalidconfirm. Explicitset3 acceptsA/B/C→FIRST/SECOND/THIRD/focusafterC, rejectsD, returns[A,B,C]. Rejectedcandidate remainsNOT ENTERED.'),
 ('R14','QC49 negative raw/public number','RawRuleSet−1 number aliases publicmax6, while StandardRules−1 overrides number withraw−1 but publicmax remains6. Therefore rawsixthadditionfocusesCONFIRM/cap6; Standard rawnegative hasno positivecapacity/focus, though final6canpass andfinal7failsmax6. ExplicitsetNumber(−1)clampsbothends1.'),
 ('R16','TotalAdjustment108–125 finite constants','Given min15/max20/total50 and3targets, initial45 then source-order additions produce17/17/16. With total40 initial45alreadyexceedsbudget, noneincrements and15/15/15remain. No executed allocation loop/model.'),
 ('S01','calc_stats in receivedFIP-F05','Direct HP recalculation preserves absolute damage: oldtotal100/hp40 to newtotal80 gives hp20. Oldhp0 with positive total increment20 becomes20; it is not proportional32 or fixed40, and not blanket fainted preservation.'),
 ('R16','adjust47–78/unadjust34–45 withreceivedPokemonEXPunits','Same requested level skips level=/calc_stats and preserves midlevelEXP; changed level writes new lowestEXP via actual levelsetter thenstats without learning newmoves. Restoration writes savedfullEXP by current index, invalidatingcachedlevel via exp= and recalculating; missing savedEXP skips, equalEXPskipsrecalc.'),
 ('R10','Q45 wrapper-index finite composition','Given reorderedB/A, savedfullEXP/item at0 go toB andat1 toA. Other side equalEXP skipsrecalc butnormalcleanupstillheals/restoresitem. NewC beyondoldEXPskipsEXP, beyondolditemgetsheldnil. Order-preservedcontrol restorescorrect owners; no identity matching/transaction added.'),
 ('R10','Q46 normal/failure prefixes40–97','Normal followsheal→adjust→itemsnapshot→create/prepare/start→EXPrestoration→allplayercleanup→allopponentcleanup→record/stats. Adjustmentlaterthrow canleave earlier temporary levels beforeitemsnapshot; uncaughtbattlethrow skipscleanup; EXPrestorelaterthrow canleave earlierEXP beforecleanup; playercleanupthrow leavesprefixplayerwrites and later/opponents untouched. Savefalse is a separate normal return, no generic rollback.'),
 ('RC-SETTINGS','MAX_PARTY_SIZE220','The fixed default declaration isMAX_PARTY_SIZE6. It supplies publicnegative-max fallback, complete-input floor and UIconfirmindex/annotation count; no other Settings domain transferred.'),
 ('R06','Q43/Q44 Perish checkpoint finite interpretation','With all original symmetric Lapras/nootheractions/given speeds premises, both PerishSong counters save sourceplayer0 before faint clears effects; same-side saved sources select checkpointplayer0. drawclausetrue/nootherlistedclauses setsdecision2 whenbothsidesallfainted; noninternalGainExp returnswithoutchangingit and positiveEOR/mainloop exitsretain2. Swappinglastmoverto0 changesno storedsongsource; ordinary selfkoclause lastuserdirection remains separate.')]
